## CFG-5 · How the config reaches the agents

`skills.py` exposes template variables to every SKILL.md: `{{words_target}}`, `{{words_min}}`, `{{words_max}}`, `{{paragraphs_min}}`, `{{paragraphs_max}}`, `{{pov}}`, `{{tense}}`, `{{chapters_total}}`, `{{chapter_number}}`, `{{tone}}`. A SKILL.md that hardcodes a number where a variable exists fails `tools/check_specs.py`.

