## CFG-9 · Tests

| id | asserts |
|---|---|
| CFG-T1 | unknown field, missing required field, wrong type → `ConfigError` with the field path |
| CFG-T2 | `min ≤ target ≤ max` and all ranges above are validated |
| CFG-T3 | writer prompt contains ≤ `prior_summary_max_words` words of summary and only listed Bible files |
| CFG-T4 | Length Critic: draft of 712 words vs max 550 → score 0 and a `words_per_chapter.max` issue; draft in range → 10 |
| CFG-T5 | edit live config during a run → `resume` still uses snapshot values |
| CFG-T6 | `outputs.formats: ["markdown","pdf"]` produces exactly `book.md` and `book.pdf`; requesting `epub` → `ConfigError` |
| CFG-T7 | pipeline runs under `mock` for all four profiles with zero code differences |
| CFG-T8 | PDF and Markdown wrap at the same `chars_per_line.max`; PDF starts `%PDF-`, xref resolves, page count > 0 |
| CFG-T9 | every `{{variable}}` in CFG-5 is substituted in the assembled prompt; no literal `{{` remains |

