## CFG-10 · Acceptance for the first (tiny) run

`novaforge new "..." --config config/novel.config.json` with the file above must produce:
- `state.json`: 3 chapters `approved`, `config_hash` present, no secrets.
- `critiques/chNN.length.json` for every chapter, every accepted draft within 300–550 words and ≤ 70 lines.
- `dist/book.md` and `dist/book.pdf`, nothing else in `dist/`.
- `logs/cost.json` total ≤ 2.0 USD (simulated under mock).
- Changing only `"profile": "small"` and re-running produces 6 chapters of 700–1100 words with no code diff (`git diff --stat -- '*.py'` empty).
